+// Mystic Enchants whose behaviour needs memory or checks that the wcme_enchant_action table cannot express
+// (coa-wildcard-mystic). Each script is bound to the enchant's spell in spell_script_names, and a spell_proc row
+// on that spell says which events reach it (sql/enchants/017-enchant-scripts.sql). Every handler prevents the
+// enchant's own (blanked) trigger effects and does exactly what the tooltip says instead.
